title: Arranged by its imports, every folder puts what is imported first and what imports it after, keeps cycles together, dashes what goes against the order, and remembers it
folders: deps-folders
limit: 150
expect-log: arranged 'deps-folders' by its imports: \d+ layers at most, [1-9]\d* cycles kept together
expect-log: script: deps order of 'src': util 0, core 1, data 1, api 1, ui 1, app 2$
expect-log: script: deps order of 'src/ui': widgets 0, pages 1$
expect-log: script: deps order of 'src/util/util0': util0\.ts 0,
expect-log: script: deps [1-9]\d* edges go against the order
expect-log: script: the layout, the symbol index and the dependencies are what building them again gives
expect-log: script: deps \d+ of \d+ edges drawn, bundled, [1-9]\d* counts
again-expect-log: arranged 'deps-folders' by its imports
again-expect-log: script: deps order of 'src': util 0, core 1, data 1, api 1, ui 1, app 2$
forbid-log: script: not what building again gives
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
right deps
fit
wait 1200
mark by-name
wait 400
deps arrange on
wait 1500
fit
wait 1200
mark arranged
wait 400
deps order src
deps order src/ui
deps order src/util/util0
count
goto src/data
wait 1500
fit
wait 1200
deps report
mark folder-edges-arranged
wait 400
goto src/util/util0/util2.ts
wait 1500
zoom 0.6
wait 1200
mark cycle-arranged
wait 400
quit

=== again
wait 3000
deps order src
fit
wait 1200
mark arranged-again
wait 400
quit
